    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Sakana Fugu is an API only family, so there are no open weights to download or self host, and every version is reached through a provider. All 3 versions support reasoning and share a 1000000 token context window with a 128000 token maximum output, which suits long documents, large codebases, or multi file inputs. Inputs accept file, image, and text, and output is text only. The spread is narrow: Fugu Max costs $2 per million input and $6 output, while Fugu Ultra and Fugu Ultra v2 cost $5 input and $30 output, so the Ultra tier is the expensive option for heavy generation. The facts suggest the family fits long context reasoning and document or image analysis work, while budgets and offline or self hosted use are the clear limits.",
